Patience...patience...patience...

Whenever you can't find a obvious way out or in, don't panic.  There
is a way.  The Gnome Mines are a dead end.  Once you hit the bottom,
there is no way out except back the way you came.  The entrance/exit
to the Mines is a staircase on level 2 to 5 that connects the Mines
and the Dungeon.  If you can't find it, it is probably hidden under
some object.  To get out, go up as far as you can and check every 
square with stuff on it.  You will find the stairs sooner or later...

